      "rationale": "Scope categorisation offers a plausible new grouping axis, though it is only loosely tied to the query about hardware failure causes. Groundedness is weak: 'individual_device' and 'system_wide' are inferred from terse descriptions where the source text rarely states scope. The MySQL row labelled 'system_wide' is an unsupported specific."
